<title>MEXICO: Telmex to begin paying cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Telmex to begin paying cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telephone company Telefonos de Mexico SA (Telmex) said on Tuesday it will begin paying its 1996 dividends for holders of AA shares, A shares and L shares.</p>
<p>Telmex will pay a cash dividend of 0.175 pesos per share beginning on June 19, and make two further payments of equal amount at a later date, it said in information published through the Mexican Stock Exchange. The other two payments are expected to be made on September 18 and December 18, 1997.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
